<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "A chat loses things. The address somebody typed, the link to the build, the paragraph worth reading twice — all of it scrolls. Saving is for the moment you already know you will want it later."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_star}>{dgettext("help_features", "Keeping a line")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Right-click a message — long press on a phone — and choose Save for Later. The same menu offers Remove from Saved on a line you already kept. It works on channel messages and on private ones."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_btn_address_book}>
  {dgettext("help_features", "Nobody else can see it")}
</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Saving is private. The author is not told, no count is shown to anyone, and nothing appears beside the message. It is a note to yourself, not a vote."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_channels}>{dgettext("help_features", "Getting it back")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Start ▸ Tools ▸ Saved Messages lists everything you kept, newest first, and each row goes back to the line in its own conversation. You can keep up to 500; each one can carry a short note about why."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="ui-saved-window">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Saved Messages Window")}
  </.help_link>
  | <.help_link topic="feature-search">{dgettext("help_features", "Search")}</.help_link>
</p>
